<item><title>Mauritius extends police commissioner&apos;s contract for one year</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-extends-police-commissioner-s-contract-for-one-71e9e5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-extends-police-commissioner-s-contract-for-one-71e9e5/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>Prime Minister Navin Ramgoolam confirmed in parliament that Rampersad Sooroojbally will stay on as the country&apos;s police chief.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:29:16 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-extends-police-commissioner-s-contract-for-one-71e9e5/share.jpg" length="41257" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-extends-police-commissioner-s-contract-for-one-71e9e5/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
